    <title>给 Obsidian 移动端伴侣加图片查看器：手势与翻页共存、AI 品牌焕新与一个 CJK 环境坑</title>
    <link href="https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/09/16/2026-09-16-obsidian-companion-viewer-rebrand/"/>
    <id>https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/09/16/2026-09-16-obsidian-companion-viewer-rebrand/</id>
    <published>2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z</published>
